<title>UK: UK's Peek sells Husky to WPI.</title>
<headline>UK's Peek sells Husky to WPI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British data and communications company Peek Plc said on Monday that it is selling the Husky Computers Group to U.S. firm WPI Group Inc for 10 million stg.</p>
<p>Peek will use the proceeds from the sale to reduce group debt and invest in its core business of traffic and measurement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
